    "detailed_description": "Embark on an otherworldly adventure with a cosmic slime as your guide. In the tranquil realms of the spiritual forests, your amorphous companion wanders peacefully until the arrival of extraterrestrial beings. These intergalactic invaders seek to harvest the souls of the sacred trees that sustain cosmic balance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs you reach higher levels, the number of monsters will increase. Remember that killing them will provide you with valuable resources, use them to improve your skills and enhance the power of your cosmic slime.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNavigate the platforms taking advantage of the terrain to gain strategic advantages in your battle. Jump and maneuver quickly, using the environment to outwit your enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring your adventure you will be accompanied by cosmic sound effects provided by zapsplat that will make your experience more immersive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSurvive the growing waves of adversaries and use your skills to eliminate threats before they extinguish the essence of your cosmic existence. Remember, the protagonist slime stands as the defender of the cosmos, fighting valiantly to ensure another day of existence.",
